music BGM18B.mp3
text I wonder if that young man is smiling right now.
text Having found such a reassuring friend.
text He probably is...
text That guy can get along with anyone, no matter who they are.
text And he will then make them smile.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I knew it. You really are amazing...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (I couldn't catch up to him, even if I worked at it my entire life...)
text The bus winds its way through the highway at an earth-shattering speed.
text He's bleeding so much. His consciousness must be fading by now.
text He's traveling with death.
text He's probably enjoying himself immensely, though.
text Every time it looks like he's about to plunge into the median strip, every time the bus swings over so much it looks like it's about to tip over, he's probably laughing out loud.
text The image goes blurry.
text Before I know it, tears have formed in my eyes.
text @[Tomoya]
text (What's this?)
text @[Tomoya]
text Haha...
text I wipe them off, then look at Nagisa and Sanae-san.
text They're both the same.
text They are smiling, their eyes filled with tears.
text I wonder what it is... this feeling we're all having right now...
text I don't quite understand it.
text The bus continues running wild on the TV screen.
text It slowly eases up its velocity.
text And then, failing to make the next turn, it crashes into the median strip.
text Now stranded, the bus finally crawls to a stop.
text It is surrounded by police cars and ambulances.
text One after another, the police break the windows on the bus, climbing inside...
text ...and the announcer reports the conclusion of the incident.
