text We split up and start looking for the old man.
text Sanae-san's probably also looking somewhere else.
text This has to be unprecedented.
text Having a seriously wounded patient go missing like that just after they regain consciousness.
text He shouldn't even be able to move about all that much due to the pain from his wound.
text @[Tomoya]
text (It's so reckless...)
text If he's really all right, then why doesn't he just show us his smiling face?
text He really doesn't know...
text just how much we've all been longing for that.
