text Tch... So you found me, huh?
text He looks up at me with a pained expression.
text @[Tomoya]
text Were you trying to play hide and seek or something? You realize we were worried and looking all over for you?
text @[Tomoya]
text You're supposed to be wounded. Seriously, you're so damned reckless...
