text @[Akio]
text It looks like that guy's grandmother has already passed on.
text For a moment, I didn't understand what he was talking about.
text The police...
text I do remember them coming to see Sanae-san yesterday.
text So, he grabbed one of those policemen here just now, and asked them what happened?
text In that case, he must be talking about that boy.
text I think this grandmother was the person he was supposed to be heading off to go see.
text But she's gone now...
text @[Tomoya]
text That so...
sound R5Z.aac
text @[Akio]
text But, well, apparently he himself managed to not be too upset about it.
